  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The BODMAS rule is given as follows:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/82c3e40a02b8c826e0d868ad0661efd9dcbce5afdb4d9591a54019ab40c8b055.png] \n\nGiven equation: 8 ÷ 4 × 6 + 3 - 9 = 1\n\nNow, we check the options and see which one follows:\n\nOption 1) + and ×, 4 and 6\n\n→ 8 ÷ 4 × 6 + 3 - 9 = 1\n\n→ __**8 ÷ 6**__ + 4 × 3 - 9 = 1\n\n→ 1.33 + __**4 ×**____** 3**__ - 9 = 1\n\n→ __**1.33 + 12**__ - 9 = 1\n\n→ __**13.33 - 9**__ = 1\n\n→ 4.33 ≠ 1\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) × and +, 4 and 9\n\n→ 8 ÷ 4 × 6 + 3 - 9 = 1\n\n→ __**8 ÷ 9**__ + 6 × 3 - 4 = 1\n\n→ 0.88 + __**6 **____**×**____** 3**__ - 4 = 1\n\n→ __ **0.88 ****+ 18**__ - 4 = 1\n\n→ __**18.88 - 4**__ = 1\n\n→ 14.88 ≠ 1\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 3) × and ÷, 8 and 9**\n\n→ 8 ÷ 4 × 6 + 3 - 9 = 1\n\n→ __**9**____** × 4 ÷ 6 **__+ 3 - 8 = 1\n\n→ __**6 + 3**__ - 8 = 1\n\n→__** 9 - 8**__ = 1\n\n→ 1 = 1\n\n→ LHS = RHS\n\nOption 4) + and -, 6 and 9\n\n→ __**8 ÷ 4**__ × 9 - 3 + 6 = 1\n\n→ __**2 × 9**__ - 3 + 6 = 1\n\n→ 18 - **__3 + 6__** = 1\n\n→ __**18 - 9 **__= 1\n\n→ 9 ≠ 1\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 3\".",
